          </div>
          <h1 style={{ fontSize: 44, fontWeight: 900, color: 'var(--color-text-secondary)', marginBottom: 8 }}>
            拼团<span style={{ color: 'var(--color-primary)' }}>专区</span>
          </h1>
          <div style={{ color: 'var(--color-text-secondary)', fontSize: 16 }}>
            一起拼，更优惠
